<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine mid-term elections set for Oct 26.</title>
<headline>Argentine mid-term elections set for Oct 26.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's mid-term elections will be held October 26, local media reported Tuesday.</p>
<p>The elections will renew half of the seats in the lower house of Congress. Of the 127 positions at stake, 62 are currently held by the ruling Peronist party, 41 by the main opposition Radical party and six by the center-left party Frepaso.</p>
<p>The remaining 18 seats belong to minority parties.</p>
<p>((-- Ariel Said, Buenos Aires Newsroom 541 318-0633))</p>
